      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't even care about the voice part, but I would like messaging. Mainly because sometimes people just wanna show up 'just to check in', when really they just mean say hi and leave. Which can be annoying.\n\nAlso, it can be useful for if you just need to contact someone real quick to tell them something. Not everyone has everyone's Discord so sometimes the only way is join them. Which is not always an appropriate time to do. So messages would be very useful.\n\nOffline ones could also help if you need to say something but someone already logged off. Which it could be important. Like changes in plans.\n\nI've been wanting this feature for awhile.\n\nHowever I'd also honestly like a 'Creator Inbox' kinda thing where someone can leave a note on a world for the creator that can only be read by them. That way they can let them know if anything is wrong. Like it's causing lag, crashes, there's a bug, ect. I feel like these things could be helpful for useful communication between users.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
