      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would love to see an Asynchronous Messaging System be added. Since I’m not trying to pull out my VR headset to ask a friend for there discord info at like 10/11PM. The Development Team definitely needs to work on something like this. They just have been holding back our words, even though they say to make a feedback request, they just don’t actually take it into account.",
